abstract: >-
  Pre-alpha research prototype for groupoid-based aggregation on Riemannian
  manifolds. The supported point-valued path uses explicit invertible point
  actions, a basis-dependent cycle-holonomy defect diagnostic, the cellular
  sheaf Laplacian, and Karcher mean aggregation. Tangent-vector parallel
  transport utilities are provided separately. Earlier H^1-norm terminology
  is superseded by the construct definition in CORRECTION_NOTICE.md.
